// Desktop background renderer with click handling and transitions.
//
// The background fills the entire screen behind the bar, so it must be
// positioned at Z=0. It renders two layers: a static image and a dynamic
// gradient. Both layers fade out when the wallpaper is disabled; the
// gradient fades to transparent instead of solid black.
//
// Clicks pass through the overlay to the desktop below, which handles them
// according to the current mode (workspaces, launcher, etc.). A single
// click toggles workspaces; double-click opens the launcher.
//
// Transitions animate both layers independently. They run on the layer
// being shown/hidden rather than the one being hidden, so they can't
// overshoot or flicker. The visible layer stays visible throughout the
// transition, so the user sees the change without a flash.
